<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <h2>Your Attendance Regularization has been {{status}}</h2>

  <p>Dear {{employeeName}},</p>

  <p>Your attendance regularization request has been <strong>{{status}}</strong> by {{approverName}}.</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Date:</strong> {{shiftDay}}</li>
    <li><strong>Requested In Time:</strong> {{fromTime}}</li>
    <li><strong>Requested Out Time:</strong> {{toTime}}</li>
    <li><strong>Reason:</strong> {{reason}}</li>
    {{#if comments}}
      <li><strong>Approver's Comments:</strong> {{comments}}</li>
    {{/if}}
  </ul>

  <p>You can log in to the Zuno HR portal to view the full details.</p>

  <p>Best regards,</p>
  <p>{{companyName}} Zuno HR</p>
</div>
